<title>CHINA: China Light's Miller to retire from board.</title>
<headline>China Light's Miller to retire from board.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd said on Sunday K.A. Miller will retire from the company's board on August 29, 1997.</p>
<p>Miller was appointed a company director in 1975, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843-6590</p>
